            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Windows (PowerShell, come amministratore)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You allowed the other person to save a video of this session.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sie haben der anderen Person erlaubt, ein Video dieser Sitzung zu speichern."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous avez autorisé l’autre personne à enregistrer une vidéo de cette session."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ha consentito all’altra persona di salvare un video di questa sessione."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You are using this device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sie verwenden dieses Gerät."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous utilisez cet appareil."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stai usando questo dispositivo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You type the ID under Connect and choose Connect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sie geben die ID unter Verbinden ein und wählen Verbinden."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous saisissez l’ID sous Connecter et choisissez Connecter."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Digita l’ID in Connetti e sceglie Connetti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your clipboard was updated.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ihre Zwischenablage wurde aktualisiert."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre presse-papiers a été mis à jour."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I tuoi appunti sono stati aggiornati."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your colleague gets the invitation in Mixel Remote and joins this session. The person at the computer is asked first, unless unattended access is set up.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ihre Kollegin oder Ihr Kollege erhält die Einladung in Mixel Remote und kommt in diese Sitzung. Die Person am Computer wird zuerst gefragt, ausser unbeaufsichtigter Zugriff ist eingerichtet."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre collègue reçoit l’invitation dans Mixel Remote et rejoint cette session. La personne devant l’ordinateur est d’abord sollicitée, sauf si l’accès sans surveillance est configuré."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il Suo collega riceve l’invito in Mixel Remote e si unisce a questa sessione. Alla persona al computer viene chiesto prima, a meno che sia configurato l’accesso non presidiato."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your company gets a 14-day Business trial, no card needed. You become its owner and can invite your team.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ihre Firma erhält 14 Tage Business zum Testen, ohne Karte. Sie werden Inhaber und können Ihr Team einladen."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre entreprise reçoit un essai Business de 14 jours, sans carte. Vous en devenez propriétaire et pouvez inviter votre équipe."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La Sua azienda riceve una prova Business di 14 giorni, senza carta. Ne diventa titolare e può invitare il Suo team."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your connection ID": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ihre Verbindungs-ID"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre ID de connexion"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il Suo ID di connessione"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your devices belong here": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hier erscheinen Ihre Geräte"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos appareils apparaissent ici"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qui compaiono i tuoi dispositivi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your meeting opens in the browser. Choose “Share screen” there; the other person is asked to watch.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ihr Meeting öffnet sich im Browser. Wählen Sie dort «Bildschirm teilen»; die andere Person wird gefragt, ob sie zusehen möchte."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre réunion s’ouvre dans le navigateur. Choisissez « Partager l’écran » ; l’autre personne est invitée à regarder."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La riunione si apre nel browser. Scegli «Condividi schermo»; all’altra persona viene chiesto di guardare."
          }
        }
      }
    },
